{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>is delivered</b> — from וְחָלְצוּ אֶת הָאֲבָנִים (Genesis 29:3), meaning HaShem delivers him from trouble decreed upon a person." "<b>and the wicked comes</b> — into trouble in his stead, to serve as his ransom."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:06.095075934Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}